tools.description:
Next departures (train, bus, tram) from one Swiss station or stop: time, line, destination, platform, live delay.
Use when: someone is at (or going to) a Swiss station and wants the next departures.
Example: {"station":"Bern"}

Finds the exact Swiss station or stop names matching a word (German, French or Italian names).
Use when: a place name is ambiguous or misspelled.
Example: {"query":"Lausanne"}
